WEBVTT

00:00:06.100 --> 00:00:11.610
I share my unstoppable curiosity with you.

00:00:13.690 --> 00:00:17.410
I'm still able to run through the fog...

00:00:17.445 --> 00:00:21.100
...because I know that you're here for me.

00:00:21.200 --> 00:00:28.830
I guess the shape of happiness is different for everyone...

00:00:28.830 --> 00:00:33.170
...however, I know it's boring when I'm alone...

00:00:33.590 --> 00:00:35.050
But, with you...

00:00:35.050 --> 00:00:37.138
...it's like a mystery!

00:00:38.970 --> 00:00:42.720
It's an enchanting future, where...

00:00:42.890 --> 00:00:47.440
...in order for me to be strong, it's always you...

00:00:47.440 --> 00:00:51.820
...that I can continue to depend on, right?

00:00:51.820 --> 00:00:53.400
Just to survive!

00:00:53.570 --> 00:00:55.360
Stumped Q? Don't lose your way!

00:00:55.360 --> 00:00:57.200
Take this moment...

00:00:57.200 --> 00:01:00.820
...to fix your gaze and charge on ahead!

00:01:00.820 --> 00:01:03.030
Eternally, we'll always be together...

00:01:03.030 --> 00:01:04.870
...searching and pursuing...

00:01:04.870 --> 00:01:08.580
...the meaning of it all.

00:01:08.580 --> 00:01:10.710
Truth is nothing but a labyrinth...

00:01:10.710 --> 00:01:12.420
...that we try to continue through...

00:01:12.420 --> 00:01:16.090
...especially when we are hurt.

00:01:16.090 --> 00:01:18.260
I'll take you, so come this way.

00:01:18.260 --> 00:01:20.090
I'm certain that, on that day...

00:01:20.090 --> 00:01:24.010
...I'll see your smile, face to face!

00:01:32.164 --> 00:01:36.042
At the request of Ichinose Kaoru-san, Kyuu's
classmate from middle school...

00:01:36.168 --> 00:01:41.256
...we attended a seance to recall
the spirit of her mother...

00:01:41.381 --> 00:01:43.467
...who had been killed six months
ago in a plane crash.

00:01:44.676 --> 00:01:48.847
However, as the seance began,
something terrible happened.

00:01:49.514 --> 00:01:51.683
Spirit of Ichinose Hanayo...

00:01:52.225 --> 00:01:56.605
Return to us so that we may know the
place where your will is hidden.

00:02:04.029 --> 00:02:05.447
W-What are you doing?

00:02:07.282 --> 00:02:09.326
Please instruct everyone to let go of
each other and turn on the lights.

00:02:10.285 --> 00:02:11.703
This is very strange indeed.

00:02:13.330 --> 00:02:14.498
Where's the switch?

00:02:18.126 --> 00:02:21.922
All twelve of us were joining hands.

00:02:22.547 --> 00:02:26.259
How is it possible to kill Asakura-san,
when she was in the middle?

00:02:26.510 --> 00:02:27.928
It must have been the spirit.

00:02:28.136 --> 00:02:30.055
Hanayo-san's spirit is outraged!

00:02:30.514 --> 00:02:32.516
This is a well-planned murder!

00:02:32.933 --> 00:02:33.850
Ryu-kun...

00:02:34.392 --> 00:02:37.103
And the culprit is one of us!

00:02:38.355 --> 00:02:42.275
Not a spirit, but an actual culprit!

00:02:48.657 --> 00:02:49.533
It's me.

00:02:50.075 --> 00:02:51.159
This is Nanami.

00:02:51.993 --> 00:02:54.120
My instinct was correct.

00:02:55.080 --> 00:02:57.874
Even though I was there, I'm sorry.

00:02:59.000 --> 00:03:00.669
There was a murder at the Ichinose residence.

00:03:01.127 --> 00:03:02.003
I see.

00:03:02.921 --> 00:03:04.256
Continue your surveillance.

00:03:05.090 --> 00:03:06.007
Understood.

00:03:15.600 --> 00:03:18.979
Kyuu-kun, don't startle me like that! Geez!

00:03:21.022 --> 00:03:24.276
I'm jealous! You have a swing in your backyard.

00:03:28.154 --> 00:03:30.907
I haven't sat here in a long time.

00:03:31.116 --> 00:03:33.493
When I was younger, I would swing
here with my brothers.

00:03:33.618 --> 00:03:37.289
...beside me, and my mom pushing.

00:03:39.499 --> 00:03:43.461
My father died from an illness long
before I could remember.

00:03:43.837 --> 00:03:46.715
From then on, there were just
four of us in the family.

00:03:47.299 --> 00:03:49.634
But, I was never lonely.

00:03:50.260 --> 00:03:54.389
Even when my mother was working...

00:03:54.639 --> 00:03:59.436
...Akihiko-niisan and Tomohiko-niisan
always played with me.

00:04:00.770 --> 00:04:05.900
But, they've changed since my
mother's company grew...

00:04:06.526 --> 00:04:08.862
...and we became richer.

00:04:12.490 --> 00:04:17.037
They both quit the schools they
worked so hard to apply for.

00:04:17.746 --> 00:04:21.958
Tomohiko-niisan played around
with girls every night...

00:04:22.751 --> 00:04:25.879
...and Akihiko-niisan became a gang member.

00:04:26.630 --> 00:04:28.882
The real reason why the company
filed for bankruptcy...

00:04:29.174 --> 00:04:33.261
...is because of the money spent and
the trouble caused by my brothers.

00:04:36.514 --> 00:04:41.144
...my mother died in a plane crash, making
her life insurance money available.

00:04:41.561 --> 00:04:43.605
The company was able to recover
from that money, but...

00:04:44.272 --> 00:04:46.941
...at this rate, my house will...

00:04:47.692 --> 00:04:48.818
Say, Ichinose...

00:04:50.862 --> 00:04:52.947
Let's find your mother's will.

00:04:53.531 --> 00:04:54.240
Eh?

00:04:54.366 --> 00:04:58.411
Asakura-san was killed, putting
a stop to the seance...

00:04:59.120 --> 00:05:00.246
...but it's still possible...

00:05:00.747 --> 00:05:02.999
...that your mother really did leave a will.

00:05:04.876 --> 00:05:07.504
If we find that will, I'm sure
it will have instructions...

00:05:07.754 --> 00:05:12.342
...that will satisfy your whole family, right?

00:05:15.053 --> 00:05:16.179
Kyuu-kun...

00:05:17.055 --> 00:05:18.098
Right? let's do it!

00:05:18.765 --> 00:05:20.392
Let's ask everyone to help us!

00:05:21.267 --> 00:05:22.352
Find her mother's will?

00:05:22.936 --> 00:05:25.480
Yes. If we find the secrets of the will...

00:05:25.605 --> 00:05:27.982
...they may reveal the truth behind this case.

00:05:30.318 --> 00:05:31.236
Alright!

00:05:35.031 --> 00:05:37.450
I doubt that she hid it under the house.

00:05:37.575 --> 00:05:39.494
I know that! I'm just making sure.

00:05:41.871 --> 00:05:42.789
What is this?

00:05:43.498 --> 00:05:44.624
A greenhouse?

00:05:45.291 --> 00:05:46.626
It's locked.

00:05:47.419 --> 00:05:49.587
Oh, well. Let's go back inside.

00:05:49.838 --> 00:05:50.588
Okay.

00:05:56.302 --> 00:05:57.387
What should we do now?

00:05:57.512 --> 00:05:59.931
We can't search through their private rooms.

00:06:01.599 --> 00:06:02.767
Yeah, but...

00:06:05.937 --> 00:06:07.605
Sachio, did you find it?

00:06:08.356 --> 00:06:09.858
Hey, what are you doing?

00:06:10.066 --> 00:06:11.735
You're so paranoid.

00:06:12.026 --> 00:06:13.069
It's okay.

00:06:13.153 --> 00:06:16.030
I'm the only person who can wear
my sister's clothes anyway.

00:06:16.114 --> 00:06:17.532
Think of it as sharing.

00:06:17.699 --> 00:06:19.409
So, how do I look? Does it suit me?

00:06:21.494 --> 00:06:24.122
So, this is what they mean by
the "audacity of the thief".

00:06:24.122 --> 00:06:25.874
T-Tomohiko-kun...

00:06:26.249 --> 00:06:30.086
I wondered what you were up to,
going into my mother's room.

00:06:30.253 --> 00:06:33.298
So, it's the luxurious clothes you were after.

00:06:35.800 --> 00:06:38.803
Is it okay for you to speak to me like that?

00:06:41.431 --> 00:06:42.056
Who's there?

00:06:45.185 --> 00:06:46.603
The door was open, so...

00:06:51.065 --> 00:06:54.444
Well, I don't care if you are in a detective club.

00:06:54.944 --> 00:06:59.449
I don't want anyone wandering
in my mansion, understand? '

00:06:59.991 --> 00:07:03.369
I won't forgive you a second time,
even if you are Kaoru's friends.

00:07:03.411 --> 00:07:04.454
We're sorry.

00:07:15.632 --> 00:07:17.091
Have the police left yet?

00:07:17.175 --> 00:07:20.011
No, they are still inspecting the crime scene.

00:07:20.512 --> 00:07:23.431
I'm sure they'll try to interrogate
us when they're done.

00:07:23.890 --> 00:07:27.185
Honestly, how could we have killed her?

00:07:27.811 --> 00:07:29.938
What's more, Kaoru's friends
were here at the time...

00:07:29.979 --> 00:07:31.898
...so we have a solid alibi.

00:07:32.565 --> 00:07:34.692
Please, help yourselves.

00:07:35.276 --> 00:07:37.946
Well then, let's eat!

00:07:40.448 --> 00:07:41.991
D-Delicious!

00:07:43.117 --> 00:07:45.036
Kazuma, these cookies aren't bad!

00:07:45.036 --> 00:07:48.790
How can you eat after seeing
somebody murdered?

00:07:49.082 --> 00:07:50.333
What are you saying?

00:07:50.542 --> 00:07:53.962
It's important to eat at a time like this.

00:07:55.338 --> 00:07:56.339
Geez.

00:07:57.799 --> 00:08:01.010
Shouhei-sama, would—you join us for some tea?

00:08:02.804 --> 00:08:04.305
Do you know where Sachio is?

00:08:04.889 --> 00:08:06.891
I haven't seen her for a while.

00:08:08.351 --> 00:08:09.477
My aunt?

00:08:10.687 --> 00:08:12.272
We'll look for her with you.

00:08:16.651 --> 00:08:18.361
The key to the greenhouse?

00:08:18.903 --> 00:08:22.782
I lent that to Kusaka-san earlier.

00:08:23.366 --> 00:08:24.701
The key to the greenhouse?

00:08:25.076 --> 00:08:28.246
I don't think Sachio would be there.

00:08:28.246 --> 00:08:31.124
But, we've Checked everywhere
except the greenhouse...

00:08:31.332 --> 00:08:34.335
...and the police said no one has left the estate.

00:08:34.919 --> 00:08:36.921
Alright, let's go check.

00:08:49.434 --> 00:08:50.226
Sachio?

00:09:05.742 --> 00:09:10.079
Someone was murdered in the
presence of the police?

00:09:10.455 --> 00:09:13.166
This is unprecedented!

00:09:17.086 --> 00:09:18.504
Let's review this situation again.

00:09:19.088 --> 00:09:22.675
The victim is Kusaka Sachio. The cause
of death was strangulation.

00:09:22.967 --> 00:09:25.762
However, it's clear that this is
a murder and not suicide.

00:09:26.179 --> 00:09:28.765
She was found inside the greenhouse.

00:09:29.432 --> 00:09:33.645
You were the only one with the key to that
greenhouse, right Kusaka Shouhei-san?

00:09:34.729 --> 00:09:39.651
I-I was the only one with the key, but...

00:09:39.859 --> 00:09:41.486
Don't "But..." me!

00:09:41.861 --> 00:09:44.530
What business did you have in the greenhouse?

00:09:45.782 --> 00:09:48.451
The reason I went to the greenhouse...

00:09:50.495 --> 00:09:52.038
Is there a reason why you can't tell us?

00:09:52.330 --> 00:09:53.706
I-It was for the will!

00:09:54.624 --> 00:09:55.375
The will?

00:09:55.792 --> 00:09:58.127
I went to look for Hanayo-san's will.

00:09:59.087 --> 00:10:04.717
Sachio instructed me to destroy
it if it didn't benefit us.

00:10:05.426 --> 00:10:09.263
B-but, there was no one in the
greenhouse when I was there.

00:10:09.806 --> 00:10:14.227
Kusaka-san, your fingerprints were the only set on the lock...

00:10:14.602 --> 00:10:16.938
...and there's no sign off tampering
with a Lock pick.

00:10:17.188 --> 00:10:18.815
Furthermore, there's no other key!

00:10:19.023 --> 00:10:21.776
Either way, you just admitted that you
were the only one at the greenhouse.

00:10:21.985 --> 00:10:24.946
These facts all point to you
being the perpetrator!

00:10:25.363 --> 00:10:26.155
But...

00:10:26.948 --> 00:10:27.782
"But... "?

00:10:28.658 --> 00:10:30.284
When I searched for the will...

00:10:30.660 --> 00:10:33.746
...I felt a presence outside the greenhouse.

00:10:35.123 --> 00:10:38.209
I went to look, but I didn't see anyone, so...

00:10:38.918 --> 00:10:42.005
...I was frightened and returned to the mansion.

00:10:44.048 --> 00:10:45.800
Then, this happened.

00:10:46.801 --> 00:10:49.595
It must be the spirit of Hanayo-san!

00:10:50.304 --> 00:10:52.473
Hanayo-san is angry at Sachio!

00:10:53.182 --> 00:10:54.183
What a fool!

00:10:54.684 --> 00:10:56.686
We'll continue this at the station.

00:10:56.978 --> 00:10:58.521
Take him away!

00:11:01.190 --> 00:11:02.275
Please hold on.

00:11:02.775 --> 00:11:07.238
What? A child shouldn't interfere
with adult business!

00:11:07.447 --> 00:11:11.951
But, Shouhei-san is not the
only possible suspect.

00:11:12.118 --> 00:11:12.994
What?

00:11:13.453 --> 00:11:15.621
Because with a little trick....

00:11:16.289 --> 00:11:18.624
...anyone can enter the greenhouse.

00:11:19.250 --> 00:11:20.710
W-What?

00:11:31.806 --> 00:11:35.393
Kusaka-san is not the only possible suspect.

00:11:36.352 --> 00:11:37.603
With a little trick...

00:11:38.187 --> 00:11:40.147
...anyone can enter the greenhouse.

00:11:40.565 --> 00:11:41.732
W-What?

00:11:45.987 --> 00:11:47.989
You better explain yourself!

00:11:49.073 --> 00:11:53.369
The trick is simple if you know the
full characteristics of a padlock.

00:11:54.203 --> 00:11:55.413
Characteristics?

00:11:55.913 --> 00:11:58.916
The characteristic that it needs a key to open it...

00:11:59.333 --> 00:12:01.877
...but it doesn't require a key to lock it.

00:12:02.712 --> 00:12:05.631
What? What? I have no idea what you just said.

00:12:05.881 --> 00:12:08.050
Explain it more clearly!

00:12:09.260 --> 00:12:10.136
Alright.

00:12:11.053 --> 00:12:15.474
First, this is the same lock that was
on the door of the greenhouse.

00:12:15.808 --> 00:12:17.435
Where did you find the same lock?

00:12:17.685 --> 00:12:19.186
While I was searching for the will...

00:12:19.478 --> 00:12:21.939
...I found it on the latch of the storeroom.

00:12:22.898 --> 00:12:23.649
Ootaguro-san...

00:12:24.233 --> 00:12:28.112
Are there other places in the mansion
that use the same lock?

00:12:28.571 --> 00:12:29.238
Yes.

00:12:29.488 --> 00:12:32.074
Some of the other locks are the same.

00:12:32.366 --> 00:12:34.118
You should have said so before!

00:12:35.328 --> 00:12:37.413
But, the keys to them should all be different.

00:12:37.747 --> 00:12:41.500
Even if they are the same type of padlock,
they should all use different keys.

00:12:41.876 --> 00:12:42.877
Of course.

00:12:43.794 --> 00:12:47.048
Kusaka-san, when you were.in the
greenhouse looking for the will...

00:12:47.340 --> 00:12:49.508
...where did you leave the lock?

00:12:50.217 --> 00:12:52.762
I left it on the latch.

00:12:53.346 --> 00:12:54.305
I see!

00:12:54.805 --> 00:12:56.974
The perpetrator must have
switched that padlock.

00:12:57.224 --> 00:13:00.770
...with the one he had, while
Kusaka-san was inside!

00:13:01.228 --> 00:13:02.480
Switched?

00:13:06.525 --> 00:13:07.234
That's right.

00:13:08.944 --> 00:13:13.032
And after seeing someone outside, Kusaka-san...

00:13:14.283 --> 00:13:17.578
...didn't realize that the padlock was different.

00:13:18.788 --> 00:13:21.999
He locked it without realizing
that it was switched.

00:13:23.000 --> 00:13:26.504
By then, Sachio-san must have
already been murdered.

00:13:27.797 --> 00:13:31.300
The perpetrator unlocked the padlock
with the key he had, and...

00:13:31.676 --> 00:13:34.887
...placed the corpse inside
in order to clear suspicion.

00:13:35.721 --> 00:13:39.392
Then, he replaced the original padlock...

00:13:41.143 --> 00:13:43.270
...and completed the scaled room trick.

00:13:44.438 --> 00:13:46.148
I see, but...?

00:13:46.941 --> 00:13:48.150
...that means...

00:13:48.526 --> 00:13:49.735
...the culprit is...

00:13:51.070 --> 00:13:52.905
I doubt any outsiders came in...

00:13:53.197 --> 00:13:55.741
...while the police were inspecting
the crime scene.

00:14:00.413 --> 00:14:01.956
This had to have been the work of an insider.

00:14:02.373 --> 00:14:05.334
In other words, the culprit is among us.

00:14:07.294 --> 00:14:08.838
We're back where we started!

00:14:09.296 --> 00:14:11.924
Alright, so inspect the greenhouse! Move!

00:14:12.091 --> 00:14:12.591
Yes, sir!

00:14:14.510 --> 00:14:16.595
So one of us is the murderer, huh?

00:14:16.721 --> 00:14:19.306
I don't want to share the same
room with a serial killer!

00:14:20.725 --> 00:14:22.560
You're under suspicion too, you know?

00:14:31.402 --> 00:14:32.319
Nabeshima-san...

00:14:32.611 --> 00:14:33.320
<i>Y-Yes?</i>

00:14:33.404 --> 00:14:35.656
May I see the letter of request
from Hanayo-san...

00:14:35.823 --> 00:14:38.784
...that Asakura Kousci-sap brought?

00:14:39.869 --> 00:14:41.829
The letter of request?

00:14:42.455 --> 00:14:43.205
But...

00:14:43.497 --> 00:14:44.373
Please!

00:14:47.543 --> 00:14:48.335
Here it is.

00:14:48.919 --> 00:14:53.466
It was sent directly to Agakura Kousei-san,
the spirit medium...

00:14:53.716 --> 00:14:56.594
...from Ichinose-san in this envelope.

00:14:58.512 --> 00:15:01.348
It's ripped right at the date stamp...

00:15:01.557 --> 00:15:03.350
...so you can't tell when it was postmarked.

00:15:03.726 --> 00:15:07.229
But, the address and the sender...

00:15:07.396 --> 00:15:10.691
...written on the envelope are clearly
written by Ichinose-san.

00:15:11.859 --> 00:15:16.113
Tomohiko-san and Akihiko-san hired experts
to analyze the letter and envelope...

00:15:16.155 --> 00:15:19.408
...and they concluded that
is was her handwriting.

00:15:23.412 --> 00:15:24.038
Huh?

00:15:24.663 --> 00:15:26.040
Is something wrong?

00:15:27.583 --> 00:15:30.544
<i>This is weird, but what could it mean?</i>

00:15:32.505 --> 00:15:33.881
Hey, Kyuu, come quick!

00:15:34.465 --> 00:15:35.341
It's Kaoru-Chan.

00:15:40.095 --> 00:15:40.930
Ichinose!

00:15:41.388 --> 00:15:42.348
Kyuu-kun!

00:15:42.723 --> 00:15:44.725
The detective says that I'm under suspicion!

00:15:45.893 --> 00:15:47.019
What do you mean, Detective?

00:15:47.978 --> 00:15:50.773
It's very obvious! It's process of elimination.

00:15:51.232 --> 00:15:52.441
Process of elimination?

00:15:53.108 --> 00:15:53.818
Yes.

00:15:54.235 --> 00:15:56.028
The only person who didn't...

00:15:56.403 --> 00:15:58.614
...join hands with the members of...

00:15:58.781 --> 00:16:03.369
...the detective club is the only
one who could have...

00:16:03.494 --> 00:16:05.663
...committed the crime.

00:16:06.831 --> 00:16:07.957
What do you mean?

00:16:08.999 --> 00:16:10.668
Do you need it spelled out for you?

00:16:11.001 --> 00:16:16.340
The motive of this crime was to
silence Asakura Kousei-san...

00:16:16.507 --> 00:16:20.344
...because she knew the location of Ichinose
Hanayo's will, which held the key...

00:16:20.386 --> 00:16:22.471
...to her immense fortune.

00:16:23.097 --> 00:16:24.139
Take a look at this!

00:16:24.598 --> 00:16:25.724
Ah, my laptop!

00:16:26.308 --> 00:16:27.893
Ichinose Kaoru was the only one...

00:16:27.977 --> 00:16:30.813
...who didn't join hands with you outsiders.

00:16:31.063 --> 00:16:36.443
Furthermore, she was in-between the Kusaka
couple, who were the likely inheritors.

00:16:37.444 --> 00:16:38.404
Understand?

00:16:38.654 --> 00:16:41.323
In other words, these three conspired...

00:16:41.532 --> 00:16:46.954
...and let go off Kaoru's hands
to make the crime possible.

00:16:47.371 --> 00:16:48.163
But...

00:16:48.581 --> 00:16:52.293
Kusaka Sachio-san was probably killed
when she got into an argument...

00:16:52.418 --> 00:16:54.003
...over how to split the fortune
with the other two.

00:16:54.587 --> 00:16:59.133
So, Kusaka Shouhei-san, you
come to the station too.

00:16:59.675 --> 00:17:02.261
But, can you really interrogate
them at the station...

00:17:02.344 --> 00:17:04.763
...with just those questionable reasons?

00:17:05.264 --> 00:17:07.266
There are other reasons, too.

00:17:07.933 --> 00:17:09.393
Alright, I'll prove it to you.

00:17:10.227 --> 00:17:11.896
Hey, bring the evidence.

00:17:12.229 --> 00:17:12.813
Yes, sir!

00:17:13.772 --> 00:17:15.190
Is this the one?

00:17:15.357 --> 00:17:15.983
Yes.

00:17:16.483 --> 00:17:20.905
This is the tape that Fujisawa-san
recorded during the seance.

00:17:21.572 --> 00:17:26.452
I'll play it now, so listen carefully
to who is talking.

00:17:28.495 --> 00:17:30.289
Now then, Sensci, you may proceed.

00:17:30.956 --> 00:17:33.000
That is Fujisawa-san's voice.

00:17:34.168 --> 00:17:36.587
It's really dark in here!

00:17:36.837 --> 00:17:37.671
That's me!

00:17:37.880 --> 00:17:38.631
Shh!

00:17:39.214 --> 00:17:40.049
That's me.

00:17:40.674 --> 00:17:43.427
Has everyone joined hands with
the person next to you?

00:17:43.844 --> 00:17:46.096
Now, everyone please step back...

00:17:47.056 --> 00:17:48.015
Why are you fast-forwarding?

00:17:48.098 --> 00:17:49.767
The most important part is after this.

00:17:57.775 --> 00:17:58.901
W-What are you doing?

00:18:01.195 --> 00:18:03.447
W-What was that voice?

00:18:03.572 --> 00:18:04.990
That's my voice.

00:18:05.824 --> 00:18:08.077
Is my sister's spirit in pain?

00:18:08.702 --> 00:18:09.703
That was Sachio.

00:18:10.162 --> 00:18:11.497
Hey, don't talk.

00:18:11.997 --> 00:18:13.248
That's me.

00:18:13.582 --> 00:18:15.834
Please don't move.

00:18:16.251 --> 00:18:19.922
If it is my mother, I want to meet her.

00:18:20.214 --> 00:18:23.342
You sound really calm here, Kaoru-san.

00:18:24.969 --> 00:18:28.472
She's right! If we're too loud,
we may scare her away.

00:18:29.264 --> 00:18:32.434
Everyone please settle down.
I'm sure Sensei is okay.

00:18:33.268 --> 00:18:37.064
But, this is different from the first time.

00:18:37.856 --> 00:18:40.067
That was Fujisawa-san and Nabeshima-san.

00:18:40.192 --> 00:18:44.446
Fujisawa-san? Um, this is Kyuu speaking.
May I ask you something?

00:18:44.905 --> 00:18:46.907
Yes. What is it, Kyuu-san?

00:18:47.449 --> 00:18:50.536
This seems very strange. Is she really okay?

00:18:53.122 --> 00:18:56.583
From this point on only members
of the detective Club spoke.

00:18:57.167 --> 00:18:59.545
Well? Don't you think they're suspicious?

00:18:59.628 --> 00:19:00.462
Huh?

00:19:00.462 --> 00:19:03.340
You still don't get it? Geez,
what a bunch of morons!

00:19:03.507 --> 00:19:08.554
Listen! The only ones that spoke at the time
of the murder were Kaoru and the Kusaka's.

00:19:09.138 --> 00:19:12.516
Why did they keep on talking?

00:19:13.058 --> 00:19:17.354
Because, they wanted to divert the attention
from the crime they were committing!

00:19:17.730 --> 00:19:19.940
That's why they Were talking.

00:19:20.357 --> 00:19:21.984
That's the only way to think about it.

00:19:25.863 --> 00:19:28.115
<i>Wait a minute, this tape...</i>

00:19:28.574 --> 00:19:30.159
<i>I got it! Maybe...</i>

00:19:31.452 --> 00:19:33.662
Kusaka Shouhei! Ichinose Kaoru!

00:19:33.912 --> 00:19:36.540
As the prime suspects, we will interrogate...

00:19:36.832 --> 00:19:38.292
...both of you at the station!

00:19:38.709 --> 00:19:40.502
That's nonsense!

00:19:41.795 --> 00:19:42.671
Okay, take them away!

00:19:43.422 --> 00:19:44.423
Kyuu-kun!

00:19:45.090 --> 00:19:46.091
Ichinose!

00:19:46.341 --> 00:19:48.135
H-Hey wait!

00:19:50.345 --> 00:19:51.430
Please hold on!

00:19:53.307 --> 00:19:57.019
Unfortunately, your theory
is obviously inconsistent.

00:19:57.603 --> 00:19:59.063
You again?

00:19:59.605 --> 00:20:00.439
Ryu-kun!

00:20:01.565 --> 00:20:06.070
It's too simplistic to make Kaoru
a suspect on the basis that...

00:20:06.487 --> 00:20:11.575
...she was the only one who didn't join hands
with a member of the detective club.

00:20:12.993 --> 00:20:15.079
I'll prove that to you now.

00:20:15.496 --> 00:20:17.039
I-Interesting!

00:20:17.289 --> 00:20:19.541
A kid like you trying to pretend
to be a detective!

00:20:19.750 --> 00:20:23.128
Alright, I'll listen to what you have to say!

00:20:24.046 --> 00:20:28.383
Megu, there's something that I want you to
remember with your photographic memory.

00:20:28.926 --> 00:20:29.927
What is it, Ryu-kun?

00:20:30.344 --> 00:20:31.720
Before the seance began...

00:20:32.221 --> 00:20:36.058
...we formed a circle at Fujisawa-san's
request, right?

00:20:37.643 --> 00:20:41.522
I want you to remember everyone's
location in that circle.

00:20:42.147 --> 00:20:43.774
Okay, I'll try.

00:20:44.274 --> 00:20:48.529
Also, Kazuma, I want you to
input that on your laptop.

00:20:48.654 --> 00:20:49.363
Okay.

00:20:50.656 --> 00:20:51.365
I'm ready.

00:20:51.490 --> 00:20:56.745
Well, if we place Ichinose Tomohiko-san
at 12 o'clock...

00:20:56.954 --> 00:21:01.083
...and go clockwise, there's assistant
Fujisawa-san, Kusaka Sachio-san...

00:21:01.250 --> 00:21:03.418
...Kusaka Shouhei-san, Kinta...

00:21:03.627 --> 00:21:07.673
...Ichinose Akihiko-san at.6 o'clock,
the secretary Nabeshima-san...

00:21:07.840 --> 00:21:10.092
...Ichinose Kaoru-Chan, and Kazuma.

00:21:10.676 --> 00:21:13.303
Kyuu, Ryu-kun, and I were not in the circle...

00:21:13.470 --> 00:21:14.555
...but standing beside the window.

00:21:15.347 --> 00:21:16.974
I see! Just as I thought!

00:21:17.432 --> 00:21:19.101
Thanks, Megu and Kazuma.

00:21:20.894 --> 00:21:22.563
Please take a look, Detective Odajima.

00:21:23.147 --> 00:21:27.651
In this circle, Kaoru was between
Kazuma and Nabeshima-san.

00:21:28.026 --> 00:21:29.069
So what?

00:21:29.444 --> 00:21:32.239
I'm talking about the cider of the
circle at the time of the crime!

00:21:32.781 --> 00:21:35.200
The order before the crime isn't that significant.

00:21:35.659 --> 00:21:36.368
Yes.

00:21:37.161 --> 00:21:37.911
But...

00:21:38.412 --> 00:21:39.955
...if it wasn't for the members of...

00:21:40.080 --> 00:21:43.584
...the detective club who asked for
the order to be rearranged...

00:21:44.084 --> 00:21:49.131
...Kaoru-san would not have
been between the Kusaka's.

00:21:50.632 --> 00:21:52.759
Do you understand this inconsistency?

00:21:53.427 --> 00:21:54.136
Huh?

00:21:55.053 --> 00:21:59.016
Your theory of the Kusaka couple and Kaoru-san
conspiring to commit the crime...

00:21:59.808 --> 00:22:05.230
...is only possible after we requested
a rearrangement.

00:22:07.232 --> 00:22:10.861
In other words, it was just a coincidence
that she was between the Kusaka's...

00:22:10.861 --> 00:22:13.822
...and it clearly wasn't planned.

00:22:14.239 --> 00:22:19.870
Therefore, your claim that the Kusaka's and
Kaoru-san conspired to commit the crime...

00:22:20.037 --> 00:22:21.496
...is disputable.

00:22:24.708 --> 00:22:29.338
But then, how was the victim murdered?

00:22:30.255 --> 00:22:35.052
It's impossible to kill someone in the middle
while everyone else is joining hands!

00:22:36.428 --> 00:22:40.474
And for the record, I do not
believe in evil spirits!

00:22:41.516 --> 00:22:43.268
I agree.

00:22:44.228 --> 00:22:48.315
There must be some kind of trick that
made this impossible crime possible.

00:22:49.149 --> 00:22:49.900
We're here...

00:22:50.192 --> 00:22:51.026
I know...

00:22:53.904 --> 00:22:55.405
...the trick used in this murder...

00:22:56.073 --> 00:22:58.450
...and who the true culprit is.

00:22:59.326 --> 00:23:00.285
What?

00:23:00.577 --> 00:23:03.038
The trick used in this murder?

00:23:03.747 --> 00:23:05.666
You know who the true perpetrator is, you say?

00:23:06.041 --> 00:23:07.042
Are you serious?

00:23:07.501 --> 00:23:09.086
I-It can't be!

00:23:09.503 --> 00:23:10.462
Kyuu-kun?

00:23:12.256 --> 00:23:13.423
There are three hints!

00:23:13.882 --> 00:23:16.635
First, the victim's clothing.

00:23:18.971 --> 00:23:22.516
Second, the conversation recorded on the tape.

00:23:24.309 --> 00:23:25.352
And the third one...

00:23:25.769 --> 00:23:30.023
...are the similarities between the circles
that Kazuma input on his computer.

00:23:31.191 --> 00:23:31.984
The answer is...

00:23:37.242 --> 00:23:40.449
The Sun is setting in a red glow...

00:23:41.015 --> 00:23:43.580
...as it follows me.

00:23:43.886 --> 00:23:46.749
Along this deserted beach...

00:23:46.752 --> 00:23:50.683
...I walk alone once more.

00:23:50.690 --> 00:23:54.027
I can't continue to hold in...

00:23:54.651 --> 00:23:57.049
...the tears that should pour out.

00:23:57.686 --> 00:24:00.153
Why have these memories...

00:24:00.163 --> 00:24:03.693
...become so wonderful?

00:24:04.198 --> 00:24:09.256
Ah... Like an ocean wave, I return to you...

00:24:09.506 --> 00:24:12.029
...because I'm so in love.

00:24:12.760 --> 00:24:15.746
And, now my heart...

00:24:15.751 --> 00:24:17.890
...is heavy with pain.

00:24:18.844 --> 00:24:21.742
Reflections of a bright rainbow...

00:24:21.836 --> 00:24:26.047
...shine on the distant shores of yesterday.

00:24:26.351 --> 00:24:29.981
I'll never forget those days...

00:24:29.984 --> 00:24:35.066
...and I long to see you again.

00:24:38.064 --> 00:24:39.190
The mystery is solved!

00:24:39.941 --> 00:24:42.110
The work of an evil spirit is actually a trick!

00:24:42.610 --> 00:24:44.362
The true identity of the murderer
in the darkness...

00:24:44.946 --> 00:24:48.199
Our conclusion reveals a harsh reality.

00:24:49.033 --> 00:24:52.161
And beyond that, another tragedy!

00:24:53.287 --> 00:24:54.539
There is only one answer!

00:24:57.250 --> 00:25:00.461
Hey, hey! Did you know that an elementary
school kid created this game?

00:25:00.545 --> 00:25:01.170
Wow!

00:25:01.170 --> 00:25:05.341
And, the bishounen detective in the
game was modeled after him!

00:25:06.092 --> 00:25:08.010
Then, he must be really handsome!

00:25:08.094 --> 00:25:09.543
I guess you could say that.

00:25:10.548 --> 00:25:11.567
Who's this kid?
